4.2 Sequencing Logic
The pipeline is built bottom-up: each service function is verified in isolation — via /test-image for the image stage — before being chained into a route. A failure during route integration is then a wiring bug, not a model bug, which cuts debugging time sharply.

4.3 Risk Register
Risk	Impact	Mitigation
Stable Diffusion too slow on CPU	Poor UX on non-GPU machines	Fewer inference steps, smaller resolution, or offload to HF Inference API
Gemini returns malformed JSON	Pipeline crash at parse step	Request JSON mode explicitly; wrap parse in try/except with a repair pass
Panel images stylistically inconsistent	Comic feels disjointed	Shared style suffix appended to every panel prompt
API rate limits during a 5-panel run	Partial comic	Retry with backoff per panel; isolate failures
Keys committed to repo	Credential leak	.env in .gitignore; ship .env.example
